#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "Environment"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid ""
"Everything secret or host-specific: credentials, database connection, "
"feature switches"
msgstr "一切属于密钥或与主机相关的东西：凭据、数据库连接、功能开关"

#: ../developer/configuration.md
msgid "`Settings` in `apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py`"
msgstr "`apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py` 中的 `Settings`"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:18
msgid ""
"Only the model registry is load-bearing. Without it the gateway starts, "
"serves `/health`, and answers `GET /v1/models` with an empty list. "
"Without a routing file the registry's own per-route weights stand — which"
" is also what a fresh clone gets, because the built-in default "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml` declares empty endpoint pools "
"rather than overriding anything. Without an alerts file the built-in "
"thresholds apply."
msgstr ""
"只有模型注册表是承重的。没有它，网关照样启动、照样提供 `/health`，`GET /v1/models` "
"返回一个空列表。没有路由文件，注册表自己的每条路由权重继续生效——一份全新的 clone 拿到的其实也是这个效果，因为内置默认值 "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml` 声明的是空的端点池，不会覆盖任何东西。没有告警文件，则采用内置阈值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:25
msgid ""
"A fourth kind, `mcp`, is accepted by the resolver and by the distribution"
" manifest schema, but nothing at this revision reads it."
msgstr "还有第四种类型 `mcp`，解析器和 distribution manifest 的 schema 都接受它，但在当前修订版本里没有任何代码读它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:28
msgid ""
"The files are not the whole story once a database is configured. The "
"admin console writes providers, keys, routes, weights and per-model "
"overrides to the operational store, and the gateway re-applies that state"
" on top of the loaded registry at every start. [Runtime configuration "
"from the admin console](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console) "
"covers that layer."
msgstr ""
"配置了数据库之后，文件就不是全部了。管理控制台会把 provider、key、路由、权重和按模型的覆盖项写进运行时存储（operational "
"store），网关每次启动都会把这份状态重新套在已加载的注册表之上。[从管理控制台做运行时配置](#runtime-configuration-"
"from-the-admin-console)一节讲这一层。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:35
msgid "Where configuration lives"
msgstr "配置放在哪里"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:37
msgid ""
"There is no `config/models.yaml` or `config/routing.yaml` in this "
"repository. `config/` holds one directory, `config/examples/`, containing"
" reference files that are meant to be copied or pointed at:"
msgstr ""
"本仓库里没有 `config/models.yaml`，也没有 `config/routing.yaml`。`config/` 下只有一个目录 "
"`config/examples/`，里面是供复制或直接指向的参考文件："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:48
msgid ""
"A real deployment's configuration lives in a **distribution overlay**: "
"one directory under `distributions/` holding that deployment's manifest, "
"config files, Compose/env inputs, and branding."
msgstr ""
"真实部署的配置放在 **distribution overlay** 里：`distributions/` 下的一个目录，装着该部署的 "
"manifest、配置文件、Compose/env 输入和品牌信息。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:63
msgid ""
"The split exists so the source tree and the container image stay neutral."
" Model IDs, upstream base URLs, ports, site identity and branding are "
"properties of one deployment, not of the project; keeping them in an "
"overlay means the image can be built once and a deployment's overlay "
"mounted into it (`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` mounts the overlay "
"read-only rather than baking it into the image). It also means a clone of"
" this repository ships nobody's hosts."
msgstr ""
"这样拆分，是为了让源码树和容器镜像保持中立。模型 id、上游 base "
"URL、端口、站点标识和品牌，都属于某一个部署，而不属于项目本身；把它们放进 overlay，镜像就可以只构建一次，再把某个部署的 overlay"
" 挂载进去（`deploy/docker/docker-compose.yml` 以只读方式挂载 "
"overlay，而不是把它打包进镜像）。这也意味着，从本仓库克隆下来的代码不会带上任何人的主机地址。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:70
msgid ""
"Not every change needs a file. A provider, a key, a route or a whole "
"model can also be added from the admin console while the gateway runs; "
"that state lives in Postgres rather than in the overlay, and is described"
" [below](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)."
msgstr ""
"不是每个改动都需要一个文件。provider、key、路由乃至整个模型都可以在网关运行时从管理控制台添加；这份状态放在 Postgres 里而不是"
" overlay 里，[下文](#runtime-configuration-from-the-admin-console)会讲。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:75
msgid "How a gateway finds its config"
msgstr "网关如何找到自己的配置"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:77
msgid "Precedence is environment, then manifest, then built-in default."
msgstr "优先级依次是：环境变量、manifest、内置默认值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:79
msgid ""
"`resolve_config_path()` in `apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` "
"resolves each config kind independently, in this order:"
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/serving/config/distribution.py` 中的 `resolve_config_path()` "
"对每一种配置类型独立解析，顺序如下："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:82
msgid ""
"**An explicit environment variable.** `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`, "
"`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`, `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`. (The older names "
"`MODELS_CONFIG` and `ROUTING_CONFIG` are still accepted; the canonical "
"`*_CONFIG_PATH` name wins when both are set.) `ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH` counts"
" as an override only when you actually set it: it has a non-empty built-"
"in default, so the resolver tracks whether you supplied the value rather "
"than testing it against `\"\"`."
msgstr ""
"**显式的环境变量**。`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`、`ROUTING_CONFIG_PATH`、`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH`。（旧名"
" `MODELS_CONFIG` 和 `ROUTING_CONFIG` 仍然被接受；两者同时设置时，规范名 `*_CONFIG_PATH` "
"胜出。）`ALERTS_CONFIG_PATH` "
"只有在你真的设置了它时才算一次覆盖：它有一个非空的内置默认值，因此解析器跟踪的是你有没有提供这个值，而不是拿它跟 `\"\"` 比较。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:88
msgid ""
"**The distribution manifest's `paths:` section** — only when "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`; see below."
msgstr ""
"**distribution manifest 的 `paths:` 段**——仅当 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 时；见下文。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:90
msgid ""
"**The built-in default**, which points at the reference examples: "
"`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` and "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`. The `alerts` default is "
"`config/alerts.yaml`, a path this repository deliberately does not ship —"
" a missing alerts file means \"use the built-in thresholds\"."
msgstr ""
"**内置默认值**，指向参考示例：`config/examples/models.openrouter.yaml` 和 "
"`config/examples/routing.minimal.yaml`。`alerts` 的默认值是 "
"`config/alerts.yaml`——本仓库有意不提供这个路径——告警文件缺失就意味着「使用内置阈值」。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:96
msgid "Two consequences worth internalising:"
msgstr "有两条推论值得记牢："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:98
msgid ""
"An environment variable **beats the manifest**. If you set "
"`MODELS_CONFIG_PATH` in a deployment that also has a manifest, the "
"manifest's `models:` path becomes decorative. The gateway logs this "
"rather than hiding it (`explicit env override ... wins over manifest "
"value ...`). Pick one mechanism."
msgstr ""
"环境变量**压过 manifest**。如果一个部署既有 manifest，你又设置了 `MODELS_CONFIG_PATH`，那么 "
"manifest 里的 `models:` 路径就只是摆设。网关会把这件事记进日志，而不是把它藏起来（`explicit env override"
" ... wins over manifest value ...`）。两种机制只挑一种用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:102
msgid ""
"Paths that come from the environment are resolved relative to the "
"**working directory** of the process. Relative paths inside a manifest "
"are resolved against **the manifest file's own directory**."
msgstr "来自环境变量的路径，相对于进程的**工作目录**解析；manifest 里的相对路径，则相对于 **manifest 文件自己所在的目录**解析。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:106
msgid ""
"A path that resolves from layer 1 or 2 but does not exist is a warning, "
"not a failure: the gateway logs `Models config not found: <path> "
"(source=env)` and continues with no models registered."
msgstr ""
"从第 1 层或第 2 层解析出来、但实际并不存在的路径，只是一条警告，而不是失败：网关记录 `Models config not found: "
"<path> (source=env)`，然后在没有注册任何模型的情况下继续运行。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:110
msgid "The distribution manifest"
msgstr "distribution manifest"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:112
msgid ""
"A manifest is one versioned YAML document that names a deployment and "
"tells the gateway where its config files are. "
"`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` is the annotated reference. "
"Both examples below and in that file close public signup when activated; "
"change `public_signup` to `true` or null if this deployment should accept"
" new accounts through the public signup API:"
msgstr ""
"manifest 是一份带版本号的 YAML "
"文档，它给部署命名，并告诉网关这个部署的配置文件在哪里。`config/examples/distribution.example.yaml` "
"是带注释的参考。下方和该文件中的示例在激活后都会关闭公开注册；如果部署应该接受公开注册 API 创建的新账号，请把 `public_signup`"
" 改为 `true` 或 null："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:143
msgid "Point the gateway at it with two environment variables:"
msgstr "用两个环境变量把网关指向它："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:150
msgid ""
"With an active manifest, `features.public_signup: false` disables both "
"the signup UI and `POST /auth/signup` (HTTP 403, without creating an "
"account). Neither `SIGNUP_ENABLED=true` nor a runtime "
"`signup_enabled=true` override can reopen it. To enable public signup, "
"change the manifest to `true` or leave the field unset/null and restart "
"the backend, then ensure the effective `signup_enabled` setting is "
"enabled."
msgstr ""
"在 active 模式下，manifest 中的 `features.public_signup: false` 会同时关闭注册界面和 `POST"
" /auth/signup`（返回 HTTP 403，不创建账号）。`SIGNUP_ENABLED=true` 和运行时的 "
"`signup_enabled=true` 覆盖值都不能重新开启注册。要开放公开注册，请将 manifest 中该字段改为 `true` "
"或留空/null，重启后端，并确保最终生效的 `signup_enabled` 设置已开启。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:157
msgid ""
"The admin API rejects attempts to set `signup_enabled=true` while the "
"active manifest disables signup (HTTP 400, without saving the setting). "
"Manifest root and `features` fields reject unknown keys, including "
"`public-signup`, `publicSignup`, or a `public_signup` field at the "
"manifest root."
msgstr ""
"active manifest 关闭注册时，管理员 API 会拒绝设置 `signup_enabled=true`（返回 HTTP "
"400，不保存设置）。manifest 根节点和 `features` 会拒绝未知字段，包括 `public-"
"signup`、`publicSignup`，以及写在 manifest 根节点的 `public_signup`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:162
msgid ""
"When the manifest allows signup, the runtime `signup_enabled` setting "
"takes precedence over `SIGNUP_ENABLED` (default `true`). The same rule "
"applies with no manifest or in dark mode; dark-mode feature values have "
"no effect. `GET /site-config` reports the resulting boolean in "
"`features.public_signup`, so the console follows the backend policy. "
"Email verification, domain-based approval, and quotas remain separate "
"checks; allowing registration does not bypass them."
msgstr ""
"当 manifest 允许注册时，运行时 `signup_enabled` 设置优先于 `SIGNUP_ENABLED`（默认 "
"`true`）。未配置 manifest 或使用 dark 模式时也遵循同一规则；dark 模式下的功能字段不影响实际行为。`GET /site-"
"config` 在 `features.public_signup` "
"中返回最终布尔值，使控制台与后端策略一致。邮箱验证、按域名审批和配额仍是独立检查，允许注册不会绕过它们。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:170
msgid ""
"If a runtime signup-setting read fails or exceeds one second, the gateway"
" temporarily disables public signup. A valid `/site-config` response "
"still returns HTTP 200 with its identity and branding intact and "
"`public_signup: false`; registration returns HTTP 403 without creating an"
" account. It does not fall back to an environment value that could reopen"
" registration."
msgstr ""
"如果运行时注册设置读取失败或超过一秒，网关会暂时关闭公开注册。有效的 `/site-config` 响应仍返回 HTTP "
"200，保留站点身份和品牌，并返回 `public_signup: false`；注册返回 HTTP "
"403，不创建账号。系统不会回退到可能重新开放注册的环境变量值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:177
msgid ""
"Because `/site-config` is unauthenticated and read while rendering every "
"console page, the gateway does not repeat a failing read for every "
"request. Callers that arrive together while the setting's cache is cold "
"share one store round-trip, and a failed read is reused for five seconds,"
" so an outage costs one timeout per window rather than one per request. "
"Recovery needs no restart: the window expires on its own, and writing "
"`signup_enabled` through the administrator API clears it at once."
msgstr ""
"由于 `/site-config` "
"无需鉴权，且每次渲染控制台页面都会读取它，网关不会为每个请求重复一次失败的读取。缓存尚未预热时并发到达的调用方共享同一次存储往返，失败的读取会复用五秒，因此一次故障只在每个窗口内产生一次超时，而不是每个请求各产生一次。恢复无需重启：该窗口会自行过期，通过管理员"
" API 写入 `signup_enabled` 也会立即清除它。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:185
msgid "Dark mode is the default, and that is deliberate"
msgstr "默认是 dark 模式，这是有意为之"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:187
msgid ""
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` defaults to `dark`. In dark mode the manifest "
"is loaded and validated, and the resolver logs what it *would* change, "
"but current resolution stays effective:"
msgstr ""
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 默认为 `dark`。dark 模式下，manifest "
"会被加载并校验，解析器把它*本来会*改动的内容记进日志，但当前的解析结果仍然有效："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:197
msgid ""
"Setting only `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` therefore cannot change "
"behaviour; you get a warning telling you the mode defaulted to `dark`. "
"Config-path resolution treats an unrecognised mode as `dark` with a "
"warning. Signup, `/site-config`, and the RAG feature policy are stricter:"
" an explicitly empty or unknown mode, or `active` without a manifest "
"path, closes signup (HTTP 403), makes `/site-config` report an "
"unavailable configuration (HTTP 503), and makes authenticated "
"`/v1/rag/status` and `/v1/rag/chat` requests return HTTP 503. Only an "
"unset mode defaults to `dark`, including in Compose. Enable a manifest by"
" running dark first, reading the comparison lines, and only then setting "
"`active`."
msgstr ""
"因此，只设置 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 不会改变行为；系统会警告模式默认使用了 "
"`dark`。配置路径解析会把无法识别的模式视为 `dark` 并记录警告。注册、`/site-config` 和 RAG "
"功能策略要求更严格：显式空值、未知模式，或选择 `active` 却未设置 manifest 路径时，会关闭注册（HTTP 403），让 "
"`/site-config` 报告配置不可用（HTTP 503），并让已鉴权的 `/v1/rag/status` 和 `/v1/rag/chat`"
" 请求返回 HTTP 503。只有未设置模式时才默认使用 `dark`，Compose 中也是如此。启用 manifest 时，应先运行 dark"
" 模式、检查比较日志，再设置为 `active`。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:207
msgid ""
"Mode warnings are logged once per distinct value per process. When "
"diagnosing RAG configuration errors, check the startup logs and the "
"backend's effective `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` and "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`, rather than expecting the warning to repeat "
"on every request. Correct the values and restart the backend. See [Docs "
"RAG Assistant](rag-chat.md) for the feature restriction."
msgstr ""
"每个进程对每个不同的模式值只记录一次警告。排查 RAG 配置错误时，请检查启动日志及后端实际使用的 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE` 和 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH`，不要期待每次请求都重复警告。修正取值后重启后端。功能限制详见[文档 RAG 助手](rag-"
"chat.md)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:213
msgid ""
"Failure behaviour differs by mode, on purpose. In dark mode a manifest "
"that will not load is logged and skipped. In active mode the manifest "
"*is* where the paths come from, so a manifest that will not load — a lost"
" overlay mount, a YAML error — refuses to start rather than quietly "
"serving a different registry."
msgstr ""
"失败行为按模式区分，这是刻意的。dark 模式下，加载不了的 manifest 只被记录并跳过。active 模式下，路径*正是*从 "
"manifest 来的，所以加载不了的 manifest——overlay 挂载丢了、YAML "
"写错了——会拒绝启动，而不是悄悄用另一份注册表对外服务。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:218
msgid ""
"The manifest root and `features` are closed schemas: unknown keys are "
"rejected, including misspelled feature names or feature flags placed at "
"the root. This changes the earlier behavior that silently ignored these "
"keys. Before upgrading an active deployment, validate its actual overlay "
"with the new backend code; the repository's example manifests do not "
"validate privately maintained overlays. Correct misspellings and keep "
"operator-specific metadata in a separate file. With "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` set to the deployed manifest, run:"
msgstr ""
"manifest 顶层与 `features` 使用封闭 "
"schema：未知键会被拒绝，包括拼错的功能名称以及误放到顶层的功能开关。这改变了此前静默忽略这些键的行为。升级 active "
"部署前，请用新后端代码校验实际 overlay；仓库内的示例 manifest 不能替代对私有 overlay "
"的校验。请修正拼写，并将运维人员自定义的元数据保存在独立文件中。将 `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_PATH` 设为部署中的 "
"manifest 路径后运行："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:237
msgid ""
"This is not exhaustive typo detection: `paths`, `site`, `distribution`, "
"and `deployment` still ignore unknown section keys for compatibility. In "
"particular, check `paths.models` and the resolved model-registry log "
"before activating an overlay; an unknown path key is treated as an "
"omitted path and can select a legacy default. Strict validation of those "
"sections is a separate compatibility change."
msgstr ""
"这不是完整的拼写错误检测：为了兼容，`paths`、`site`、`distribution` 和 `deployment` "
"仍会忽略各节内的未知键。启用 overlay 前，尤其要检查 `paths.models` "
"和解析后的模型注册表日志；未知的路径键会被当作未配置路径处理，从而可能选择旧默认值。收紧这些节的校验属于另一项兼容性变更。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:244
msgid ""
"If an invalid active manifest reaches the HTTP handlers, signup remains "
"closed and `/site-config` returns HTTP 503 without exposing file paths or"
" parser errors. It cannot return a valid identity until the manifest is "
"repaired."
msgstr ""
"如果 HTTP 处理函数遇到无效的 active manifest，注册保持关闭，`/site-config` 返回 HTTP "
"503，不暴露文件路径或解析错误。在 manifest 修复前，接口无法返回有效的站点身份。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:248
msgid "Identity, and what the manifest must not contain"
msgstr "站点标识，以及 manifest 里不能放什么"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:250
msgid ""
"`site:` and `features:` are served as a public subset by `GET /site-"
"config`, and `distribution.display_name` / `site:` feed backend-rendered "
"content (transactional emails, attribution headers) through "
"`get_site_identity()` in `apps/backend/serving/config/site_identity.py`. "
"Both are gated on `DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active`; in dark mode `/site-"
"config` returns a neutral document and identity falls back to `SITE_NAME`"
" / `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` / `SITE_DOCS_URL` / `SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL` or to "
"neutral defaults."
msgstr ""
"`site:` 和 `features:` 会由 `GET /site-config` "
"以公开子集的形式对外提供；`distribution.display_name` 与 `site:` 则通过 "
"`apps/backend/serving/config/site_identity.py` 中的 "
"`get_site_identity()`，供给后端渲染的内容（事务性邮件、署名头）。两者都以 "
"`DISTRIBUTION_CONFIG_MODE=active` 为前提；在 dark 模式下，`/site-config` "
"返回一份中立文档，站点标识回退到 `SITE_NAME` / `SITE_PUBLIC_BASE_URL` / `SITE_DOCS_URL` /"
" `SITE_SUPPORT_EMAIL`，或者回退到中立的默认值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:258
msgid ""
"Manifests must not contain secrets. Credentials stay in the environment, "
"and `schema_version: 1` deliberately does not interpolate environment "
"variables into manifest values."
msgstr ""
"manifest 里绝不能放密钥。凭据留在环境变量里，而且 `schema_version: 1` 有意不把环境变量插值进 manifest "
"的取值。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:262
msgid "Backend extensions"
msgstr "后端扩展"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:264
msgid ""
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` is an optional comma-delimited list of trusted, "
"local Python module names. It is empty by default. Each module must "
"expose a synchronous `register()` function that takes no arguments. The "
"gateway imports and registers each module once per process, after loading"
" dotenv and before constructing runtime routes or consuming their "
"registries. An import or registration failure aborts startup; the gateway"
" does not silently use a different adapter."
msgstr ""
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 是可选的、以逗号分隔的受信任本地 Python 模块名列表，默认值为空。每个模块必须提供同步、无参数的 "
"`register()` 函数。网关加载 dotenv "
"后、构造运行时路由或使用相关注册表前，在每个进程中导入并注册每个模块一次。导入或注册失败会中止启动；网关不会悄悄换用其他适配器。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:271
msgid ""
"Extensions register factories through "
"`serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *, "
"override=False)`. A factory receives a configuration dictionary and "
"returns an adapter, before built-in provider defaults are applied. "
"Registering an existing extension kind is an error. Replacing a built-in "
"kind requires `override=True` and emits a log entry. Registered kinds "
"also become reserved provider labels. The startup `register()` function "
"may populate the existing runtime-setting and provider metadata "
"dictionaries before their consumers run; it must mutate those shared "
"dictionaries rather than replace them."
msgstr ""
"扩展通过 `serving.servers.registry.register_adapter_factory(kind, factory, *,"
" override=False)` 注册工厂。工厂在内置 provider 默认值应用前接收配置字典并返回适配器。注册已存在的扩展 kind "
"会报错。替换内置 kind 必须设置 `override=True`，且会记录日志。注册的 kind 也会成为保留的 provider "
"标签。启动时的 `register()` 函数可在使用方运行前，填充现有的运行时设置和 provider "
"元数据字典；必须修改这些共享字典，而不能替换它们。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:281
msgid ""
"The deployment must make these modules importable, for example through "
"its read-only overlay mount. This executes trusted server code, not user-"
"supplied configuration: do not derive module names from requests or allow"
" an admin form to choose them. The loader does not fetch remote modules "
"or load code per request. Import all extension code during startup, avoid"
" later lazy imports or live code reloads, and restart the backend when "
"changing the mounted extension. See [Deployment-local adapters](adding-"
"models.md#deployment-local-adapters) for a minimal factory example."
msgstr ""
"部署必须确保这些模块可导入，例如通过只读 overlay "
"挂载提供模块。这里执行的是受信任的服务端代码，不是用户提交的配置：不要从请求推导模块名，也不要允许管理表单选择模块。加载器不会获取远程模块，也不会逐请求加载代码。请在启动阶段导入全部扩展代码，避免之后的延迟导入或代码热重载，并在修改挂载的扩展后重启后端。最小工厂示例见[部署本地适配器"
"](adding-models.md#deployment-local-adapters)。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:290
msgid "Cloud Agent access"
msgstr "云端 Agent 访问权限"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:292
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps its fixed role hierarchy and resolves current account state. "
"The deployment owns the rule for who can use or administer its Cloud Agent. "
"A trusted extension registers one synchronous callback during `register()` with "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)`. The callback receives "
"a read-only mapping containing exactly `user_id` and `role`, after the gateway "
"has verified that the user exists and has status `active`. It receives no "
"profile, credentials, or database connection."
msgstr ""
"网关保留固定的角色层级，并解析账户当前状态。由部署定义谁可以使用或管理其云端 Agent。"
"受信任的扩展在 `register()` 中通过 "
"`serving.agent_access.register_agent_access_policy(policy)` 注册一个同步回调。"
"网关先确认用户存在且状态为 `active`，再向回调传入仅包含 `user_id` 和 `role` 的只读映射。"
"回调不会收到用户资料、凭据或数据库连接。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:300
msgid ""
"The callback returns a `list[str]` or `tuple[str, ...]` of explicit permissions: "
"`agent.use` permits Agent use, and `agent.admin` permits Agent administration. "
"Administration requires both permissions. Unknown, repeated, or non-string "
"permissions are invalid; values are not coerced. Registering a second policy is "
"an error. With no registered policy, Agent access is denied for every role. "
"The gateway imposes no deployment-specific role-to-permission rule."
msgstr ""
"回调以 `list[str]` 或 `tuple[str, ...]` 返回显式权限：`agent.use` 允许使用 Agent，"
"`agent.admin` 允许管理 Agent。管理操作需要同时具备这两项权限。未知、重复或非字符串权限"
"均无效，框架不会强制转换取值。注册第二个策略会报错。没有注册策略时，所有角色都无权访问 "
"Agent。网关不规定特定部署的角色与权限映射规则。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:307
msgid ""
"The standalone Agent reads `GET /internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access` using "
"the existing `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token. A successful response "
"contains exactly `user_id`, `allowed`, and `permissions`; `allowed` is true "
"exactly when `agent.use` is present. Permissions are returned in the order "
"`agent.use`, `agent.admin`. An intentional denial is HTTP 200 with "
"`allowed: false` and `permissions: []`. The endpoint reads the gateway's "
"operational store and evaluates the policy on each request; it does not cache "
"permission decisions. Account reads retain the existing user-cache semantics: "
"`CachedOperationalStore` caches user rows for 60 seconds, and account changes "
"through that wrapper invalidate the affected entry. Direct database edits or "
"writes in another process may remain unseen until that cache entry expires."
msgstr ""
"独立 Agent 使用现有的 `GATEWAY_GRANT_DISPATCH_TOKEN` bearer token 调用 "
"`GET /internal/users/{user_id}/agent-access`。成功响应仅包含 `user_id`、`allowed` 和 "
"`permissions`；只有包含 `agent.use` 时，`allowed` 才为 true。权限按 `agent.use`、"
"`agent.admin` 的顺序返回。策略明确拒绝访问时返回 HTTP 200，内容为 `allowed: false` "
"和 `permissions: []`。端点在每次请求时读取网关的 operational store 并评估策略，不缓存"
"权限判定结果。账户读取保留现有的用户缓存语义：`CachedOperationalStore` 将用户行缓存 "
"60 秒，通过该包装层修改账户会使对应缓存项失效。直接修改数据库或由其他进程写入的变更，"
"可能要等到缓存项过期后才会被读取到。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:319
msgid ""
"Unknown or inactive accounts receive HTTP 403 with error type "
"`subject_unavailable`, before the callback runs. A callback exception or invalid "
"result receives HTTP 503 with error type `agent_access_unavailable`, without "
"policy details. Both use the gateway's standard `{\"error\": {\"type\": ..., "
"\"message\": ...}}` envelope. Dispatch authentication and unavailable internal "
"API configuration retain their existing 401 and 404 responses. The legacy "
"user-status and model-catalog endpoints retain their existing contracts."
msgstr ""
"账户不存在或未处于 active 状态时，在调用回调前返回 HTTP 403，错误类型为 "
"`subject_unavailable`。回调抛出异常或返回无效结果时，返回 HTTP 503，错误类型为 "
"`agent_access_unavailable`，不包含策略细节。两者都使用网关标准的 "
"`{\"error\": {\"type\": ..., \"message\": ...}}` 响应结构。Dispatch 鉴权失败和内部 "
"API 未配置时，仍分别返回现有的 401 和 404 响应。旧 user-status 和 model-catalog "
"端点保留原有契约。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:327
msgid "Quota reporting"
msgstr "配额报告"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:292
msgid ""
"The gateway keeps quota reporting and quota-aware routing independent of "
"the service that measures usage. The public framework supplies the "
"Providers tab's result rows, disabled-key cards, key discovery and "
"`gather_all`, plus RouteWise's quota snapshots. No quota source is "
"enabled by default. A trusted backend extension connects an authorized "
"usage API or the operator's own metering service; the framework does not "
"require a particular supplier, website login or cookie."
msgstr ""
"网关将配额报告和配额感知路由与用量计量服务解耦。公共框架提供 Providers 标签页的结果行、禁用密钥卡片、密钥发现和 "
"`gather_all`，以及 RouteWise 的配额快照。默认不启用任何配额来源。受信任的后端扩展负责接入已授权的用量 API "
"或运营者自己的计量服务；框架不要求特定供应商、网页登录或 cookie。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:300
msgid ""
"An extension's `register()` calls "
"`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
"display_name, fetch)`; `fetch` is awaited as `fetch(operational_store, "
"services)` and returns one `ProviderQuotaResult` per configured key, "
"converting its own failures into results rather than raising. The admin "
"endpoint supplies the store and services; RouteWise currently calls it "
"with `(None, None)`, so the fetcher must also work without those objects."
" Registration runs at startup, not when the module is merely imported. A "
"fetcher queries usage; it does not send user inference requests or change"
" the route's inference protocol."
msgstr ""
"扩展的 `register()` 调用 "
"`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
"display_name, fetch)`；框架通过 `fetch(operational_store, services)` 等待 "
"`fetch` 完成，每个已配置密钥返回一个 "
"`ProviderQuotaResult`，并将失败转换成结果而不是抛出异常。管理端点会提供存储和服务对象；RouteWise 目前传入 "
"`(None, "
"None)`，因此抓取器也必须能在没有这些对象的情况下工作。注册发生在启动阶段，而不是仅导入模块时。抓取器查询用量，不负责发送用户推理请求，也不改变路由的推理协议。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:310
msgid ""
"Each result contains `ProviderQuotaUsage` rows with `label`, `used`, "
"`limit`, `unit` and an optional timezone-aware `reset_at`. The "
"deployment's provider identifier links the source to its routes; it is "
"not a hard-coded vendor enum. `quota_source.provider`, `usage_label` and "
"`unit` must exactly match a returned result and usage row. Report the "
"account/window shared by that quota pool, and keep independent accounts "
"in distinct sources. Do not sum unrelated keys or present a failed query "
"as zero usage."
msgstr ""
"每个结果包含若干 `ProviderQuotaUsage` 行，字段包括 `label`、`used`、`limit`、`unit` "
"和可选的带时区 `reset_at`。部署定义的 provider "
"标识将来源关联到路由，并不是写死的供应商枚举。`quota_source.provider`、`usage_label` 和 `unit` "
"必须与返回的结果及用量行精确匹配。报告该配额池共享账户及窗口的用量，独立账户应使用不同的来源。不要把不相关密钥的用量相加，也不要把查询失败表示成零用量。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:318
msgid ""
"The UI can display percentages, currencies and other units, but "
"RouteWise's quota admission consumes one **request** at a time and "
"requires a compatible count-based source. A percentage alone is not a "
"request allowance. The source owns window boundaries and reset times; "
"`quota.limit` is a cross-check against its reported limit, not a "
"replacement measurement. A source with no successful snapshot stays "
"unready. A failed refresh does not manufacture a fresh balance; an "
"existing pool retains its last successful snapshot and local increments."
msgstr ""
"UI 可以显示百分比、货币和其他单位，但 RouteWise "
"的配额准入每次消耗一次**请求**，要求兼容的计数型来源。只有百分比不足以表示可用请求数。来源负责窗口边界和重置时间；`quota.limit` "
"用于核对来源报告的上限，不能替代实际测量。没有成功快照的来源保持未就绪状态。刷新失败不会凭空产生新的余额；已有的池保留上一次成功快照及本地增量。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:326
msgid "Run a local quota source"
msgstr "运行本地配额来源"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:328
msgid ""
"The complete [example "
"extension](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py) reads `/usage`"
" from the bundled fake provider. Its in-memory daily counter is only a "
"teaching fixture, resets on process restart or at UTC midnight, and is "
"not production accounting. It uses no real account or credential and is "
"loaded only when explicitly selected through `BACKEND_EXTENSIONS`."
msgstr ""
"完整的[示例扩展](../../distributions/example/quota_extension.py)读取随仓库提供的模拟供应商的 "
"`/usage`。它的内存每日计数器仅用于教学，在进程重启或 UTC 午夜时重置，不能用于生产计费。它不使用真实账户或凭据，只有通过 "
"`BACKEND_EXTENSIONS` 显式选择后才会加载。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:334
msgid ""
"After the developer setup, run these commands from the repository root in"
" three terminals. First, start a simulated quota provider:"
msgstr "完成开发环境设置后，在三个终端中从仓库根目录执行这些命令。首先启动模拟配额供应商："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:342
msgid ""
"Then start a slower, priced fallback (its prices in the example are "
"fictional):"
msgstr "然后启动较慢的按量计价备用路由（示例中的价格是假设值）："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:349
msgid ""
"Finally start the gateway with the opt-in [quota "
"registry](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.yaml). Name the "
"demo token once so the admin call below can reuse it:"
msgstr "最后使用需要显式选择的[配额注册表](../../config/examples/models.routewise.quota.yaml)启动网关。先把演示用的 token 命名一次，下面调用管理接口时复用它："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:367
msgid ""
"These settings disable dotenv loading and user authentication and use a "
"public demo-only admin token and JWT signing secret: keep the listener on"
" loopback and never use them for a real deployment. The admin endpoint "
"needs the signing secret even when authenticating with the demo token. "
"Read the same result the console uses:"
msgstr ""
"这些设置关闭 dotenv 加载和用户认证，并使用公开的演示专用管理令牌和 JWT "
"签名密钥：监听地址必须保持为回环地址，绝不能用于真实部署。即使使用演示令牌认证，管理端点也需要签名密钥。读取与控制台相同的结果："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:378
msgid ""
"Send several requests to calibrate the cost envelope and allow the first "
"five-second probe/snapshot cycle to finish:"
msgstr "发送几次请求以校准成本包络，并等待首个五秒探测及快照刷新周期完成："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:387
msgid ""
"The response identifies the selected fixture. Initial requests use the "
"fallback until the quota route has both a usage snapshot and cost-"
"envelope evidence. Accepted chat requests, including active probes, "
"consume the mock quota; health, model discovery and `/usage` reads do "
"not. To simulate exhaustion, restart only the quota fixture with "
"`--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100`; after the next snapshot refresh, "
"requests continue through the fallback. Stop each local process with "
"Ctrl+C when finished."
msgstr ""
"响应会标识选中的模拟服务。初始请求走备用路由，直到配额路由同时具备用量快照和成本包络依据。已接受的聊天请求（包括主动探测）会消耗模拟配额；健康检查、模型发现和"
" `/usage` 查询不会。要模拟额度耗尽，只需使用 `--quota-limit 100 --quota-used 100` "
"重启配额模拟服务；下一次快照刷新后，请求继续由备用路由服务。完成后使用 Ctrl+C 停止各个本地进程。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:395
msgid ""
"To see the card in the authenticated Web/Admin Console, configure this "
"same extension and registry on a local full-stack demo backend, then open"
" **Providers → Quotas**. Use a quota endpoint reachable from that "
"backend: inside Compose, `127.0.0.1` denotes the backend container, not "
"the host. The [Router Tutorial](router-tutorial.md) covers the full-stack"
" demo and its authentication. With no returned results the Quotas tab "
"stays visible and links back here; Overview, Keys, Availability and "
"Performance are independent."
msgstr ""
"要在启用认证的 Web/Admin Console 中查看卡片，请在本地完整演示后端配置相同的扩展和注册表，然后打开 **Providers → "
"Quotas**。使用该后端能够访问的配额端点：在 Compose 内，`127.0.0.1` 指后端容器，而非宿主机。[路由器教程"
"](router-tutorial.md)介绍了完整演示及其认证。没有返回结果时，Quotas "
"标签页仍然显示，并链接回这里；Overview、Keys、Availability 和 Performance 功能相互独立。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:403
msgid ""
"For your own integration, copy the extension and replace its local HTTP "
"query and mapping with your authorized data source. Preserve the result "
"contract, bound network requests with a timeout, handle failures "
"explicitly and keep credentials out of responses and logs. Supplier-"
"specific authorization and service terms still apply; using an extension "
"is a software boundary, not an exemption from them."
msgstr ""
"接入自己的服务时，请复制扩展，将本地 HTTP "
"查询及字段映射替换为已授权的数据来源。保留结果契约，为网络请求设置超时，明确处理失败，并确保响应和日志不包含凭据。供应商的授权要求及服务条款仍然适用；扩展仅划分软件边界，并不能免除这些要求。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:409
msgid "The example distribution"
msgstr "示例 distribution"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:411
msgid ""
"`distributions/example/` is a complete, runnable overlay kept in the "
"repository as a teaching artifact: a manifest, a one-model registry "
"pointing at a bundled fake provider that needs no credential, Compose "
"overlays, and smoke scripts. Walk through it with the [Quickstart"
"](router-tutorial.md):"
msgstr ""
"`distributions/example/` 是一个完整、可运行的 overlay，作为教学用的样例留在仓库里：一份 "
"manifest、一份只含单个模型的注册表（指向随仓库自带、无需凭据的假 provider）、Compose "
"overlay，以及冒烟脚本。可以配合[快速开始](router-tutorial.md)走一遍："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:421
msgid ""
"It carries a marker file, `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`, whose presence keeps it out "
"of automatic discovery. The Makefile picks a distribution like this:"
msgstr ""
"它带着一个标记文件 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`，只要这个文件在，它就不会被自动发现选中。Makefile 挑选 distribution "
"的规则是这样的："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:424
msgid ""
"Overlays are discovered from `distributions/*/deploy/*.env`, minus any "
"directory containing `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY`."
msgstr "overlay 从 `distributions/*/deploy/*.env` 发现，并排除任何含有 `EXAMPLE_OVERLAY` 的目录。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:426
msgid ""
"Exactly one candidate: it is selected automatically, and `make` prints "
"which identity it is compiling in."
msgstr "恰好只有一个候选：自动选中它，`make` 会打印它正在按哪一个站点标识编译。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:428
msgid "Several candidates: `make` fails and asks you to name one."
msgstr "有多个候选：`make` 失败，并要求你指定其中一个。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:429
msgid ""
"None (the state of a fresh clone of this repository): no overlay is "
"selected, and the stack is neutral."
msgstr "一个都没有（刚克隆本仓库时就是这个状态）：不选任何 overlay，整套服务保持中立。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:432
msgid ""
