#: ../developer/configuration.md:611
msgid ""
"The registry on the Overview tab lists every provider the gateway can "
"route to, but only *custom* providers are editable there. A provider that"
" code or the model registry already owns — the built-in adapter kinds, "
"and any `provider:` label a route declares — is read-only in this table, "
"and a stored definition that reuses one of those slugs is skipped at boot"
" rather than allowed to shadow it. Custom providers are `openai_compat` "
"only; a protocol the generic adapter cannot speak needs an adapter, which"
" is a code change ([Adding a New Provider](adding-models.md#adding-a-new-"
"provider))."
msgstr ""
"Overview 标签页上的注册表列出网关能路由到的每一个 provider，但只有*自定义*的 provider "
"在那里可编辑。代码或模型注册表已经拥有的 provider——内置的适配器 kind，以及路由声明的任何 `provider:` "
"标签——在这张表里是只读的；一条复用了这些 slug 的已存定义在启动时会被跳过，而不是被允许遮蔽它。自定义 provider 只能是 "
"`openai_compat`；通用适配器说不了的协议需要一个适配器，那是代码改动（[添加新 provider](adding-"
"models.md#adding-a-new-provider)）。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:620
