"A key added here joins the same pool as the keys the registry names "
"through `${VAR}` and rotates with them. An environment key has no row of "
"its own, so the console can disable it or reserve it for a tier but "
"cannot delete it; unset the variable and restart for that."
msgstr ""
"在这里添加的 key 会进入注册表用 `${VAR}` 指名的那些 key 所在的同一个池子，并与它们一起轮换。环境变量 key "
"没有自己的行，所以控制台能禁用它、能把它预留给某个层级，但不能删除它；要删就把变量去掉再重启。"

