#: ../developer/configuration.md:636
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`GET /admin/routing/provider-routes` (or `.../{model_id}`) returns every "
"route the gateway is serving, each tagged `source: yaml`, `override` or "
"`runtime`, and is the quickest way to see what the two layers add up to."
msgstr ""
"`GET /admin/routing/provider-routes`（或 "
"`.../{model_id}`）返回网关正在服务的每一条路由，每条都标着 `source: yaml`、`override` 或 "
"`runtime`，这是看两层叠加结果最快的办法。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:640
msgid ""
"The provider selector on this tab is derived from the deployment, not "
"from a list in the code: a built-in vendor kind is offered once the "
"registry, the live route table or a configured credential names it, "
"alongside every custom provider. Which route types a provider may be "
"added as — `on_demand`, `quota` or `concurrency` — is the deployment's "
"contract with that vendor and is declared with `PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES` "
"(see [Environment variables](#environment-variables)); an unlisted "
"provider may use any of the three."
msgstr ""
"这个标签页上的 provider 选择器是从部署本身推导出来的，不是代码里的一张名单：内置的 vendor kind "
"只要被注册表、实时路由表或已配置的凭据点名，就会和所有自定义 provider 一起出现在选项里。一个 provider "
"可以按哪些路由类型添加——`on_demand`、`quota` 还是 `concurrency`——是部署与该 vendor 之间的约定，用 "
"`PROVIDER_ROUTE_TYPES` 声明（见[环境变量](#environment-variables)）；未列出的 provider "
"三种都可以用。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:649
msgid ""
"A model created here is a **runtime model**: it exists only in the "
"database, carries an id, a first route, a pricing table, a router "
"strategy and a `required_role` (default `admin`, so a new model stays "
"invisible to ordinary users until you lower it), and is restored at every"
" start. It does not carry the catalog metadata a registry entry declares "
"— context length, modalities, supported parameters, aliases — and takes "
"`ModelConfig`'s defaults for those: `context_length` 8192, "
"`max_output_length` 4096, text in and out, no tool support. When a model "
"needs any of that, put it in the registry."
msgstr ""
"在这里创建的模型是一个**运行时模型**：它只存在于数据库里，带有 id、第一条路由、一张定价表、路由器策略和一个 "
"`required_role`（默认 "
"`admin`，所以新模型在你调低它之前对普通用户不可见），并在每次启动时恢复。它不带注册表条目声明的那些目录元数据——上下文长度、模态、支持的参数、别名——这些取"
" `ModelConfig` 的默认值：`context_length` 8192、`max_output_length` "
"4096、只进出文本、不支持工具。模型需要其中任何一项时，就把它放进注册表。"

