#: ../developer/configuration.md:665
msgid "How the two layers combine"
msgstr "两层如何叠加"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:667
msgid ""
"The registry is loaded first and the stored state is applied on top of "
"it, in this order at boot; each admin change is also applied to the "
"running router the moment it is saved."
msgstr "先加载注册表，再把已存状态按下面的顺序套在它之上；每个管理改动在保存的那一刻也会被套到运行中的路由器上。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:671
msgid "Custom provider definitions, skipping any slug the code or registry owns."
msgstr "自定义 provider 定义，跳过代码或注册表已拥有的任何 slug。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:672
msgid ""
"Stored provider keys, seeded into each provider's pool beside the "
"environment keys."
msgstr "已存的 provider key，灌进每个 provider 的池子，与环境变量 key 并列。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:674
msgid "Per-model router strategy overrides."
msgstr "按模型的路由器策略覆盖项。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:675
msgid ""
"Runtime route candidates. A runtime *model* is resurrected only when its "
"commit marker is present; a candidate whose model is no longer in the "
"registry is quarantined with a warning rather than registered, so "
"removing a model from YAML does not bring it back through a leftover row."
msgstr ""
"运行时候选路由。运行时*模型*只有在提交标记还在时才会被复活；模型已不在注册表里的候选路由会被隔离并告警，而不是被注册，所以从 YAML "
"里删掉一个模型不会因为一行残留而把它带回来。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:679
msgid "Route overrides, retargeting the registry routes they name."
msgstr "路由覆盖项，把它们指名的注册表路由改指向别处。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:680
msgid ""
"Key tier reservations, re-read now that every provider is known; then "
"weight overrides, disabled providers and model visibility, loaded into "
"resolvers the router consults at request time."
msgstr ""
"key 的层级预留，此时每个 provider 都已知，于是重读一遍；然后是权重覆盖项、被禁用的 provider "
"和模型可见性，装进路由器在请求时查询的解析器里。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:684
msgid ""
"Two rules follow from that order. A stored change never edits the file it"
" overrides: delete the override and the registry route, weight or "
"`router:` value is back, and a runtime candidate sits beside the "
"registry's routes rather than replacing them. And the file still wins for"
" anything the store has no row for, so a registry edit plus restart is "
"how catalog metadata, aliases and new adapter kinds change."
msgstr ""
"这个顺序带来两条规则。已存的改动从不修改它所覆盖的文件：删掉覆盖项，注册表里的路由、权重或 `router:` "
"值就回来了；运行时候选路由是与注册表的路由并列，而不是取代它们。而存储里没有对应行的一切仍以文件为准，所以目录元数据、别名和新的适配器 kind "
"还是靠改注册表加重启来变。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:691
msgid "Environment variables"
msgstr "环境变量"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:693
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"`Settings` (`apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py`) reads a `.env` "
"file from the working directory and the process environment, case-"
"insensitively; the process environment wins. `.env.example` in the "
"repository root is the annotated list — copy it to `.env` and edit. "
"Secrets belong here and only here: not in the model registry (reference "
"them as `${VAR}`), not in the manifest."
msgstr ""
"`Settings`（`apps/backend/serving/config/settings.py`）会读取工作目录下的 `.env` "
"文件和进程环境变量，大小写不敏感；进程环境变量胜出。仓库根目录的 `.env.example` 是带注释的清单——把它复制成 `.env` "
"再改。密钥只属于这里：不放在模型注册表里（那里用 `${VAR}` 引用），也不放在 manifest 里。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:699
msgid "Running with your configuration"
msgstr "用你自己的配置运行"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:705
msgid "Then check what actually loaded:"
msgstr "然后检查实际加载了什么："

#: ../developer/configuration.md:712
msgid ""
"The startup log is the authority on resolution. `Registered N routes from"
" <path>` names the file that won; `[distribution dark mode] ...` lines "
"show what a manifest would have changed; `Skipping model '<id>' ... after"
" env expansion` names each model whose credentials were unset."
msgstr ""
"启动日志是解析结果的权威。`Registered N routes from <path>` "
"点明最终胜出的是哪个文件；`[distribution dark mode] ...` 那几行显示 manifest "
"本来会改动什么；`Skipping model '<id>' ... after env expansion` 逐个点名凭据未设置的模型。"

#: ../developer/configuration.md:718
msgid ""
"`GET /routing` requires no credentials and returns, for every published "
"route, the upstream `base_url`, its provider label and its weight — that "
"is, your complete upstream topology including any host and port embedded "
"in a base URL. Block `/routing` at your reverse proxy on any gateway "
"reachable from the internet unless you intend to publish this topology. "
"`GET /admin/routing` additionally reports unpublished routes and requires"
" an administrator's JWT or `ADMIN_TOKEN` in the `Authorization: Bearer "
"...` header. Treat both endpoints' output as sensitive."
msgstr ""
"`GET /routing` 不需要任何凭据，就会为每一条已发布的路由返回上游的 `base_url`、它的 provider "
"标签和它的权重——也就是你完整的上游拓扑，包括 base URL "
"里写着的主机和端口。任何能从公网访问到的网关，除非你有意公开这个拓扑，否则请在反向代理上挡住 `/routing`。`GET "
"/admin/routing` 还会额外返回未发布的路由，需要在 `Authorization: Bearer ...` 请求头中提供管理员的 "
"JWT 或 `ADMIN_TOKEN`。请把两个接口的输出都当作敏感信息对待。"

#~ msgid ""
#~ "Quota reporting is an extension point"
#~ " of the same shape. The gateway "
#~ "ships the Providers tab's framework —"
#~ " key discovery, per-key result rows,"
#~ " the disabled-key cards, `gather_all` "
#~ "— but no fetcher for any vendor's"
#~ " account or usage endpoint: which "
#~ "vendors' pages get read is a "
#~ "property of a deployment. An extension's"
#~ " `register()` calls "
#~ "`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
#~ "display_name, fetch)`; `fetch` is awaited "
#~ "as `fetch(operational_store, services)` and "
#~ "returns one `ProviderQuotaResult` per "
#~ "configured key, converting its own "
#~ "failures into results rather than "
#~ "raising. RouteWise `quota_source:` routes "
#~ "resolve through the same registry, so"
#~ " a deployment that meters a provider"
#~ " registers exactly one fetcher for "
#~ "it."
#~ msgstr ""
#~ "配额上报是同一形态的另一个扩展点。网关自带 Providers 标签页的框架——key 发现、按 "
#~ "key 的结果行、已禁用 key 的卡片、`gather_all`——但不带任何 "
#~ "vendor 账户或用量端点的抓取器：读哪些 vendor 的页面是部署自己的事。扩展的 "
#~ "`register()` 调用 "
#~ "`serving.admin.provider_quotas.register_quota_fetcher(provider, "
#~ "display_name, fetch)`；`fetch` 以 "
#~ "`fetch(operational_store, services)` 的形式被 "
#~ "await，为每把已配置的 key 返回一条 "
#~ "`ProviderQuotaResult`，并把自己的失败转成结果而不是抛异常。RouteWise 的 "
#~ "`quota_source:` 路由通过同一个注册表解析，所以一个对某 provider "
#~ "计量的部署恰好为它注册一个抓取器。"
